# Build output - entirely regenerated by scripts/build_csound_static.sh
# and the cmake steps in README.md. Includes the cloned/built Csound
# source tree, libsndfile, libsamplerate, the pure-data FetchContent
# clone, and every intermediate object file - ~300MB, 100% reproducible
# from source, never worth committing.
build/

# Compiled external - rebuilt from source/csound7_pd/ via
# `cmake --build`. Not tracked so the repo stays about source, not
# binaries (also keeps this consistent with the LGPL compliance notes in
# THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md, which are about the source/build scripts being
# available, not about shipping a binary in git history). Remove these
# lines if you'd rather version a built binary directly.
externals/*.pd_darwin
externals/*.pd_linux
externals/*.dll

# Third-party opcode plugins some readers may drop into plugins/ to test
# csoundLoadPlugins() locally (see plugins/README.md) - these are
# external binaries, not part of this project.
plugins/*.dylib
plugins/*.so
plugins/*.dll

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
